s populated dry/apply/repeat preservation, and refuses nearby foreign constraint/default/type/column changes. Refresh the SQL scanner's exact loader digest without changing its write policy.\n\nValidation: 4 focused suites/120 tests pass, including the write scanner and selected reported-value exports. Full local suite and GitHub CI are required before exact-head audit/merge; fresh source review, isolated proof and kit review follow. The failed rehearsal receipt 511c1951 remains FAILED and will never be retried or used by a kit. Production remains healthy at51f67988.\n\nRefs #200, #162. PR284 is merged; this is a separate forward correction.\n","created_at":"2026-10-12T12:13:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T13:34:52Z","closed_at":"2026-10-12T13:34:52Z","merged_at":"2026-10-12T13:34:52Z","merge_commit_sha":"959d17e11c357266f7c2a41b0c84ab76914c591e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigini/soilfer-lims/pulls/294/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigini/soilfer-lims/pulls/294/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigini/soilfer-lims/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigini/soilfer-lims/issues/294/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigini/soilfer-lims/statuses/5e65fe5b587747efc717f167f9b61469effa9afe","head":{"label":"yigini:codex/native-workbench-import-forward-fix","ref":"codex/native-workbench-import-forward-fix","sha":"5e65fe5b587747efc717f167f9b61469effa9afe","user":{"login":"yigini","id":32960535,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTYwNTM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32960535?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini","html_url":"https://github.com/yigini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https: